# verified sequence through finalize.tg's entry — lower -> verify ->
# annotations -> lineage -> mono -> post-mono checkpoint -> stamps ->
# optimizer -> post-opt verify -> pre-codegen firewall — and keeps only the
# harness-specific phases around it (snapshot build -> coverage emission
